      </node>
    </invincdepgraph>
    <briefdescription>
<para>This file owns the PMC WDT hardware definitions and the selection of the PMC WDT instance from the design parameters. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is deliberately self contained and does not include any platform xplmi_hw.h, so the values it produces cannot depend on which platform header a translation unit happens to pull in first. Device families without a PMC WWDT (versal, versal_2vp) match no branch below and the file is inert for them.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who  Date        Changes
<hruler/>

3.0   sd   08/20/2026 Initial release
      ng   08/27/2026 Reordered the base address for handling the device family</preformatted></para><para><preformatted></preformatted> </para>    </detaileddescription>
