<codeline lineno="42"><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">/*<sp/>PMC<sp/>WWDT<sp/>address<sp/>map,<sp/>one<sp/>branch<sp/>per<sp/>device<sp/>family<sp/>that<sp/>has<sp/>a<sp/>PMC<sp/>WWDT.<sp/>*/</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
